WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:03.297
(percussion music)

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:09.856
- I have done print
modeling, underwear, fitness.

00:00:09.856 --> 00:00:13.273
- Done a lot of runway, print,
mostly for new designers

00:00:13.273 --> 00:00:14.349
in the LA area.

00:00:14.349 --> 00:00:16.516
- I have never had braces.

00:00:17.765 --> 00:00:22.305
- I had braces for three years,
from the end of eighth grade

00:00:22.305 --> 00:00:24.694
up until about junior year of high school.

00:00:24.694 --> 00:00:26.891
My teeth were atrocious.

00:00:26.891 --> 00:00:28.766
I could fit a straw
between my two front teeth.

00:00:28.766 --> 00:00:29.936
I love the end result.

00:00:29.936 --> 00:00:31.993
I wish it didn't have to last three years.

00:00:31.993 --> 00:00:34.894
- I think braces is just kind
of like a whatever thing,

00:00:34.894 --> 00:00:36.864
and people make it out to be a big deal,

00:00:36.864 --> 00:00:39.623
and so I'm like, oh,
well, I'll try it out.

00:00:39.623 --> 00:00:41.353
- I don't think it's
going to phase me at all.

00:00:41.353 --> 00:00:42.710
- I'm excited about it.

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:45.627
(percussion music)

00:00:58.224 --> 00:01:00.307
- That looks about right.

00:01:01.875 --> 00:01:05.125
- Oh, my God. (laughs)

00:01:07.119 --> 00:01:10.065
I have so much saliva in my mouth.

00:01:10.065 --> 00:01:13.950
Look at them, they're just like there.

00:01:13.950 --> 00:01:15.540
I can't really smile.

00:01:15.540 --> 00:01:17.460
- I got the reaction from
friends that I thought I would

00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:20.598
where they would just crack
jokes and ask me if I was

00:01:20.598 --> 00:01:22.431
going through puberty.

00:01:23.759 --> 00:01:25.068
- (Courtney) Look at these braces.

00:01:25.068 --> 00:01:25.901
- Oh, my God.

00:01:25.901 --> 00:01:27.455
Are they actually, those are fake teeth.

00:01:27.455 --> 00:01:29.607
- (Courtney) They look ridiculous.

00:01:29.607 --> 00:01:31.440
- They look beautiful.

00:01:35.643 --> 00:01:37.224
- If you want straight teeth, you gotta,

00:01:37.224 --> 00:01:40.055
you gotta suffer for a little bit.

00:01:40.055 --> 00:01:41.598
It's all you can do.

00:01:41.598 --> 00:01:44.781
- No one has really been crazy.

00:01:44.781 --> 00:01:46.138
I've been smiling,

00:01:46.138 --> 00:01:48.946
because I really can't close my mouth.

00:01:48.946 --> 00:01:51.193
- There was a time where

00:01:51.193 --> 00:01:55.169
I did run my tongue across
my teeth with the braces on,

00:01:55.169 --> 00:01:58.960
and it did give me some
flashbacks to cutting my tongue,

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:01.537
or my lip, or actually having braces

00:02:01.537 --> 00:02:02.954
which was a pain.

00:02:04.577 --> 00:02:05.660
- Oh, my God.

00:02:06.918 --> 00:02:08.977
I just woke up.

00:02:08.977 --> 00:02:10.060
They do hurt.

00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:15.180
So annoying.

00:02:17.026 --> 00:02:18.896
- Based on facial expressions,

00:02:18.896 --> 00:02:22.359
I don't think people
really reacted or cared.

00:02:22.359 --> 00:02:25.678
- I went everywhere and nobody really like

00:02:25.678 --> 00:02:27.129
looked at me differently.

00:02:27.129 --> 00:02:28.908
They didn't care that I had them.

00:02:28.908 --> 00:02:31.387
They weren't like, why do you have braces?

00:02:31.387 --> 00:02:33.168
Nobody really talked about it.

00:02:33.168 --> 00:02:34.666
- Be confident in your own skin

00:02:34.666 --> 00:02:37.706
and like I said, braces aren't forever.

00:02:37.706 --> 00:02:39.204
You'll get them off and the
end result is definitely

00:02:39.204 --> 00:02:40.422
worth it.

00:02:40.422 --> 00:02:42.755
(pop music)

